  三打白骨精  ▶ 村姑 the village girl → 老妇人 → 老公公  (read)
  一个穿白衣服的姑娘走过来，手里提着一个竹篮子。她笑着说：「师父，我家就在山下。
  篮子里是我刚做的香米饭，送给你们吃。」悟空用火眼金睛一看，篮子里根本没有米饭，
  只有一堆白色的长虫在动。
  A girl in white walks up carrying a bamboo basket. She smiles and says:
  'Master, my home is just below the mountain. In the basket is fragrant rice
  I have just cooked, for you to eat.' Wukong looks with his fiery eyes: there
  is no rice in the basket at all, only a heap of long white worms wriggling.
  篮子里真的有什么？  What is really in the basket?
  ✗ You chose: 刚做的香米饭 rice just cooked
  → It was: 白色的长虫 long white worms
  唐僧生气地说：「悟空，你又看错了！你再这样乱说，我就不要你这个徒弟了。」
  Tang Sanzang says angrily: 'Wukong, you got it wrong again! Talk such
  nonsense once more and I will have you as my disciple no longer.'
  The party's morale -10. 村姑 comes again.

